OL,3,GNEWSAHusband charged with wife's murder
OL,4,Aon island
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with the murder
OL,7,Fof his wife in Alderney, police have
OL,8,Fsaid.
OL,10,FThe body of 34-year-old Hannah
OL,11,FBenfield, nee Cox, was found in the sea
OL,12,Fat the base of cliffs in the west of
OL,13,Fthe island on Monday.
OL,15,FGuernsey Police said Alderney resident
OL,16,FSimon Benfield, 44, had been charged
OL,17,Fwith her murder.
OL,19,FBenfield appeared at Guernsey
OL,20,FMagistrates' Court and has been
OL,21,Fremanded in custody until his next
OL,22,Fappearance on 28 October.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
